<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [753].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>753&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;DEHALOSPIRILLUM MEDIUM</FONT></B></P>
<I>Solution A:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> K<sub>2</sub>HPO<sub>4</sub>                                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NH<sub>4</sub>Cl                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> NaCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.25&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MgCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;6H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> CaCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;2H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.15&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Yeast extract                                           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeCl<sub>2</sub> solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=187">187</a>)                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace element solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=187">187</a>)           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Selenite-tungstate solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=431">431</a>)     </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> L-Cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.05&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.025&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;900.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components except L-cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O and FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O. Bring to a boil for a few seconds and cool down under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere. While gassing with N<sub>2</sub>, add L-cysteine&#183;HCl&#183;H<sub>2</sub>O and FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O to the solution, distribute into culture vessels (e.g., 18 ml in 50 ml serum bottles) under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere, then, seal butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  Aseptically and anaerobically add per liter (final) the following sterile solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized) from anaerobic stocks:    <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 0.1 M Potassium phosphate buffer, pH 7.5               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace vitamins (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=197">197</a>)*                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Vitamin B<sub>1</sub><sub>2</sub> solution (see Medium No. <a href="/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=403">403</a>)*      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 8% NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution*                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;42.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 25% Sodium pyruvate solution*                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;18.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 16% Sodium fumarate solution*                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;40.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Adjust pH of the medium to 7.3 - 7.7, if necessary.       <br>
